# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# The dashboard is a single-page React app (react-router). Cloudflare Pages
# serves a real static file when the path matches one (assets, logos,
# index.html); for every other path it must return index.html so the client
# router can resolve the route. Without this rule a deep link such as
# /caja/turnos returns 404 on a hard refresh.
#
# 200 = rewrite (serve index.html, keep the URL). Static assets still win first,
# so this only catches client routes.
/*    /index.html    200
